# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in for local runs that need
# authenticated Binance endpoints. Public market-data streams (what
# Phase 0's feed handler uses) don't require these at all.
#
# When these are real: use a trading-only key with NO withdrawal
# permission, IP-allowlisted to your deployment host. Never commit real
# values — see docs/PLAN.md, "Key Risks & Mitigations."
BINANCE_API_KEY=
BINANCE_API_SECRET=
